["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/sha512", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SHA-2 with a digest length of 512, as defined in [RFC 6234](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc6234/).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/orcidid", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[Open Researcher and Contributor ID (ORCID) iD](https://info.orcid.org/what-is-orcid/) is a unique identifier for authors and contributors in scholarly communication; as a subset of the International Standard Name Identifier (ISNI), it typically appears as a URI such as `https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1825-0097`.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/cpe22", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label", "cpe22", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Build/buildEndTime", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**\nUse [/Core/endTime](../../Core/Properties/endTime.md) instead.\n\nProperty that describes the time at which a build stops.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nbf45ed7179e84a32b27724c3d9dd5300", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/plannedCurrent", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/SsvcDecisionType/act", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The vulnerability requires attention from the organization's internal, supervisory-level and leadership-level individuals. Necessary actions include requesting assistance or information about the vulnerability, as well as publishing a notification either internally and/or externally. Typically, internal groups would meet to determine the overall response and then execute agreed upon actions. CISA recommends remediating Act vulnerabilities as soon as possible.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetType/graph", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Data is in the form of a graph where entries are somehow related to each other through edges, such a social network of friends.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/other", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Any other specialized or custom verification method that fits the context.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ecli", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[European Case Law Identifier (ECLI)](https://data.europa.eu/data/datasets/european-case-law-identifier-ecli) is a uniform identifier for judicial decisions across Europe. It consists of five mandatory components: the \"ECLI\" prefix, a country code, a court code, the year of the decision, and a unique serial number (e.g., `ECLI:EU:C:2023:94`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType/clickthrough", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/isci", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "International Standard Collection Identifier (ISCI) is a variable-length identifier standardized by [ISO 27730](https://www.iso.org/standard/44293.html) for identifying collections held by libraries, archives, museums, and other memory institutions. It consists of two parts: the identifier for the assigning organization (an ISIL) enclosed in square brackets, followed by a local collection identifier string (e.g., `[FR-751041001]Casadesus1`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nb68e5c2dd79e4ee3ae9e78b4c2a61127", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/filesystemImage", "globalId", "", ""]
